            "body": "Sorry about the low-quality PR, I didn't realize drafts get looked at.\r\n\r\nSo IIUC, your solution is that the terminal buffer should store a row and its continuations as one buffer line, with 'wrap' handling display?\r\nAnd this is not currently implemented because metadata is not preserved for scrollback in libvterm?\r\n\r\nIn any case, I'll close this draft since I'm not familiar enough.",
